PROJECT: PDF Password Cracking with Wordlists

1. OBJECTIVE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
To crack three password-protected PDF files using dictionary attacks with 
default wordlists from Kali Linux, demonstrating practical password security 
assessment techniques.

2. TARGET FILES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- My Locked PDF1.pdf (267 KB)
- My Locked PDF2.pdf (205 KB)  
- My Locked PDF3.pdf (313 KB)

3. TOOLS USED
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Operating System: Kali Linux
- Hash Extraction: pdf2john.pl (John the Ripper suite)
- Password Cracking: John the Ripper
- Wordlist: rockyou.txt (14 million+ common passwords)

4. METHODOLOGY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

